<resources>
    <!--
        Screens shorter than 360dp, which is where a 1024x600 panel set to a high density lands
        (at 280dpi it is 585x343dp) and where a 480x240 unit lives. There the main button, the
        favorite apps and the driver bar cannot all keep the sizes meant for a 480dp tall screen,
        and the main button's action used to be the part that got cut. Everything shrinks together
        so nothing clips. Above 360dp the values in values-h360dp apply, which are the ones the
        800x480 screens already use.
    -->
